10. Basic Web Architecture
----------------------------------------------------------

                User
                  |
                  V
          +----------------+
          |    Browser     |
          +----------------+
                  |
             HTTP Request
                  |
                  V
          +----------------+
          |   Web Server   |
          +----------------+
                  |
                  V
          +----------------+
          |      APIs      |
          +----------------+
                  |
                  V
          +----------------+
          |    Database    |
          +----------------+
                  |
             Response
                  |
                  V
          +----------------+
          |    Browser     |
          +----------------+

Explanation:

1. The user requests a webpage using a browser.
2. The browser sends an HTTP request to the web server.
3. The server processes the request.
4. If required, the server communicates with APIs and the database.
5. The database returns the requested information.
6. The server sends the response back to the browser.
7. The browser displays the webpage to the user.
